      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرْفَأٌ</span></b> , (S, Mgh, Sgh, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْفَأٌ</span></b> , (M, K,)
[<i>A station of ships;</i>] <i>a place where ships are
brought near to the bank of a river</i> [or <i>to the
land;</i> see 1, first sentence]; (S, M, K;) <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُرْضَةٌ</span>. (Mgh.)

